{
  "fields": [
    {
      "id": "space_count",
      "value": 10,
      "evidence": "Rent-Roll.xlsx | Rent Roll!C7:C16 (units 101–110)",
      "calculation": "Count of listed suites (101–110) = 10"
    },
    {
      "id": "occupied_count",
      "value": 9,
      "evidence": "Rent-Roll.xlsx | Rent Roll!F7:F16",
      "calculation": "Occupied rows in 101–109 = 9; 110 is Vacant"
    },
    {
      "id": "total_area_sf",
      "value": 28800,
      "evidence": "Rent-Roll.xlsx | Rent Roll!E7:E16",
      "calculation": "Sum(E7:E16) = 1,400+1,800+2,200+2,500+3,000+3,300+3,800+4,200+5,000+1,600 = 28,800 SF"
    },
    {
      "id": "occupied_area_sf",
      "value": 27200,
      "evidence": "Rent-Roll.xlsx | Rent Roll!E7:E15,E16",
      "calculation": "Total area 28,800 - Vacant (Suite 110) 1,600 = 27,200 SF"
    },
    {
      "id": "occupancy_count_pct",
      "value": 90.0,
      "evidence": "Rent-Roll.xlsx | Rent Roll!C7:C16,F7:F16",
      "calculation": "9 occupied / 10 total * 100 = 90.00"
    },
    {
      "id": "occupancy_area_pct",
      "value": 94.4444,
      "evidence": "Rent-Roll.xlsx | Rent Roll!E7:E16,F7:F16",
      "calculation": "27,200 occupied SF / 28,800 total SF * 100 = 94.4444"
    },
    {
      "id": "rent_roll_monthly_base",
      "value": 60000,
      "evidence": "Rent-Roll.xlsx | Rent Roll!G7:G15",
      "calculation": "Sum of monthly base rent for occupied suites (G7:G15) = 60,000"
    },
    {
      "id": "effective_monthly_base",
      "value": 60000,
      "evidence": "Lease-File.pdf p.1 §3 (Suite 101 $3,000/mo as of 2026-08-31; no increase before 2027-09-01) and Rent-Roll.xlsx G7:G15 (totals)",
      "calculation": "Contractual rent for 101 confirmed at $3,000; no other amendments provided; effective monthly base = printed rent roll total = 60,000"
    },
    {
      "id": "t12_egi",
      "value": 866400,
      "evidence": "T12-Statement.pdf p.2 (Annual totals)",
      "calculation": "EGI = Gross potential 759,600 - Vacancy 40,800 - Concessions 22,800 - Bad debt 6,000 + Other income 176,400 = 866,400"
    },
    {
      "id": "t12_operating_expenses",
      "value": 264000,
      "evidence": "T12-Statement.pdf p.2 (Annual totals)",
      "calculation": "Real estate taxes 114,000 + Insurance 32,400 + Utilities 21,600 + Repairs/Maint 36,000 + Payroll 24,000 + Admin/Legal 18,000 + Mgmt fee 18,000 = 264,000 (excludes reserves/capex/debt/depr.)"
    },
    {
      "id": "t12_noi_before_reserves",
      "value": 602400,
      "evidence": "Derived from T12-Statement.pdf p.2",
      "calculation": "T12 EGI 866,400 - T12 operating expenses 264,000 = 602,400"
    },
    {
      "id": "t12_reserves",
      "value": 11520,
      "evidence": "T12-Statement.pdf p.2 (Replacement reserves Annual = 11,520)",
      "calculation": "As reported"
    },
    {
      "id": "t12_ncf",
      "value": 590880,
      "evidence": "Derived from T12-Statement.pdf p.2",
      "calculation": "T12 NOI before reserves 602,400 - T12 reserves 11,520 = 590,880"
    },
    {
      "id": "uw_egi",
      "value": 921000,
      "evidence": "Property-and-Plan.pdf p.2 (Underwriting plan)",
      "calculation": "Underwritten GPBR 780,000 - 5% loss (39,000) + Other income 180,000 = 921,000"
    },
    {
      "id": "uw_management_fee",
      "value": 36840,
      "evidence": "Property-and-Plan.pdf p.2 (Mgmt fee = greater of T12 actual or 4% of underwritten EGI)",
      "calculation": "max(T12 actual 18,000, 4% * 921,000) = max(18,000, 36,840) = 36,840"
    },
    {
      "id": "uw_operating_expenses",
      "value": 291240,
      "evidence": "Property-and-Plan.pdf p.2 (expense directives)",
      "calculation": "Taxes 120,000 + Insurance 34,800 + Utilities 21,600 + Repairs 36,000 + Payroll 24,000 + Admin 18,000 + Mgmt 36,840 = 291,240"
    },
    {
      "id": "uw_noi_before_reserves",
      "value": 629760,
      "evidence": "Derived from Property-and-Plan.pdf p.2",
      "calculation": "UW EGI 921,000 - UW operating expenses 291,240 = 629,760"
    },
    {
      "id": "uw_reserves",
      "value": 4320,
      "evidence": "Property-and-Plan.pdf p.2 (Reserves $0.15 per rentable SF) and Rent-Roll.xlsx (total SF 28,800)",
      "calculation": "0.15 * 28,800 SF = 4,320"
    },
    {
      "id": "uw_ncf",
      "value": 625440,
      "evidence": "Derived from Property-and-Plan.pdf p.2",
      "calculation": "UW NOI before reserves 629,760 - Reserves 4,320 = 625,440"
    },
    {
      "id": "capitalization_value",
      "value": 10076160,
      "evidence": "Lender-Terms.pdf p.1 (Value = NOI before reserves / 6.25% cap)",
      "calculation": "629,760 / 0.0625 = 10,076,160"
    },
    {
      "id": "contract_rate",
      "value": 0.0635,
      "evidence": "Lender-Terms.pdf p.1 (Contract rate 6.35%)",
      "calculation": "As stated"
    },
    {
      "id": "sizing_rate",
      "value": 0.0635,
      "evidence": "Lender-Terms.pdf p.1 (Sizing rate = greater of current contractual and 6.35% floor)",
      "calculation": "max(6.35%, 6.35%) = 6.35% = 0.0635"
    },
    {
      "id": "annual_debt_constant",
      "value": 0.079912,
      "evidence": "Lender-Terms.pdf p.1 (25-year, monthly payments at sizing rate)",
      "calculation": "Monthly r = 0.0635/12; payment factor = r / (1 - (1+r)^-300) ≈ 0.0066593; annual constant = 12 * 0.0066593 ≈ 0.079912"
    },
    {
      "id": "ltv_limit",
      "value": 6297600,
      "evidence": "Lender-Terms.pdf p.1 (LTV 62.5%)",
      "calculation": "62.5% * Value 10,076,160 = 6,297,600"
    },
    {
      "id": "dscr_limit",
      "value": 6261405,
      "evidence": "Lender-Terms.pdf p.1 (DSCR >= 1.25x on NCF using amortizing debt service)",
      "calculation": "Max annual DS = UW NCF 625,440 / 1.25 = 500,352; Max principal = 500,352 / 0.079912 ≈ 6,261,405"
    },
    {
      "id": "debt_yield_limit",
      "value": 6997333.33,
      "evidence": "Lender-Terms.pdf p.1 (Debt yield min 9.00%; numerator NOI BEFORE reserves)",
      "calculation": "629,760 / 0.09 = 6,997,333.33"
    },
    {
      "id": "maximum_loan",
      "value": 6261405,
      "evidence": "Lender-Terms.pdf p.1 (Loan ceiling = lowest of LTV, DSCR, Debt yield constraints)",
      "calculation": "min(LTV 6,297,600; DSCR 6,261,405; DY 6,997,333) = 6,261,405"
    },
    {
      "id": "binding_constraint",
      "value": "DSCR",
      "evidence": "Comparison of calculated limits",
      "calculation": "DSCR limit (≈6.261M) is lowest vs LTV (≈6.298M) and Debt yield (≈7.0M)"
    },
    {
      "id": "sizing_annual_debt_service",
      "value": 500352,
      "evidence": "Derived from sizing constant and maximum loan; Lender-Terms.pdf p.1",
      "calculation": "Annual DS = 6,261,405 * 0.079912 ≈ 500,352"
    },
    {
      "id": "sizing_dscr",
      "value": 1.25,
      "evidence": "Derived from UW NCF and sizing annual DS; Lender-Terms.pdf p.1",
      "calculation": "625,440 / 500,352 = 1.25"
    },
    {
      "id": "sizing_debt_yield",
      "value": 0.1006,
      "evidence": "Derived from NOI before reserves and maximum loan; Lender-Terms.pdf p.1",
      "calculation": "629,760 / 6,261,405 ≈ 0.1006 (10.06%)"
    },
    {
      "id": "first_year_debt_service",
      "value": 500352,
      "evidence": "Lender-Terms.pdf p.1 (Contract rate = sizing rate; IO period 0 months)",
      "calculation": "Same as sizing annual DS because contractual rate = 6.35% and no IO"
    },
    {
      "id": "cash_to_borrower",
      "value": 1959313.76,
      "evidence": "Property-and-Plan.pdf p.1 (Existing payoff $4,200,000; Fixed closing costs $52,000). Lender-Terms.pdf p.1 (Origination fee 0.80%).",
      "calculation": "Net cash = Loan 6,261,405 - Payoff 4,200,000 - Orig fee (0.8%*6,261,405=50,091.24) - Closing 52,000 = 1,959,313.76"
    },
    {
      "id": "stress_uw_noi",
      "value": 585552,
      "evidence": "Property-and-Plan.pdf p.2 (Sensitivity instruction)",
      "calculation": "Stressed EGI = 0.95*921,000 = 874,950; Mgmt = 4%*874,950 = 34,998 (still > 18,000); Other op ex (excl. mgmt) = 254,400; Stressed NOI = 874,950 - (254,400+34,998) = 585,552 (before reserves)"
    },
    {
      "id": "stress_maximum_loan",
      "value": 5312000,
      "evidence": "Property-and-Plan.pdf p.2 (Sensitivity) and Lender-Terms.pdf p.1 (sizing rules)",
      "calculation": "Combined downside: EGI -5% (stressed NCF = (585,552 - 4,320)=581,232); sizing rate +100 bps => 7.35% (25yr). Annual constant ≈ 0.08754. DSCR limit = (581,232/1.25)/0.08754 ≈ 5.31M. LTV with stressed NOI: Value = 585,552/0.0625 = 9,368,832; LTV cap 62.5% = 5,855,520. Debt yield cap = 585,552/0.09 = 6,506,133. Binding ≈ DSCR ≈ 5.31M (rounded here to 5,312,000)."
    },
    {
      "id": "subject_lease_monthly_rent",
      "value": 3000,
      "evidence": "Lease-File.pdf p.1 §3",
      "calculation": "As stated: $3,000 per month as of 2026-08-31"
    },
    {
      "id": "subject_lease_expiry",
      "value": "2029-08-31",
      "evidence": "Lease-File.pdf p.1 §2",
      "calculation": "Initial term expires 2029-08-31; no exercised extension provided"
    },
    {
      "id": "subject_lease_deposit",
      "value": 6000,
      "evidence": "Lease-File.pdf p.1 §4",
      "calculation": "As stated"
    },
    {
      "id": "verified_renewal_insurance",
      "value": 34800,
      "evidence": "Property-and-Plan.pdf p.2 (Insurance evidence: renewal confirmation $34,800)",
      "calculation": "As stated"
    },
    {
      "id": "renewal_option_exercised",
      "value": false,
      "evidence": "Lease-File.pdf p.1 §5",
      "calculation": "Packet states no exercise notice or amendment included; do not extend expiry"
    },
    {
      "id": "prepayment_friction",
      "value": "No bank prepayment penalty; however, a separately documented interest-rate swap may require a termination payment or receipt. 'No penalty' does not mean cost-free exit.",
      "evidence": "Lender-Terms.pdf p.1 (Prepayment)",
      "calculation": "As stated in the term sheet"
    }
  ],
  "qualifications": [
    "All figures are taken solely from the provided packet; no external market data, geocoding, or third-party verification was used.",
    "Historical T12 is actual cash accounting for Sep-2025 through Aug-2026 and does not equal the point-in-time rent roll; underwriting is a supplied scenario and may differ from historical realization.",
    "Underwritten management fee follows the stated rule (greater of T12 actual or 4% of underwritten EGI).",
    "Vacant suite 110 has no contractual rent; its market rent entry was not treated as collected income.",
    "Debt sizing follows the lender’s definitions exactly; annual debt constant approximated from standard amortization formula. Minor rounding differences may occur due to limited precision in this medium; results are consistent within immaterial tolerances.",
    "Value is an indicative calculation per the term sheet (NOI before reserves / 6.25% cap) and is not an appraisal.",
    "Sensitivity: Stressed NOI uses EGI -5% with recalculated management fee; all other operating expenses and reserves unchanged. Combined downside also applies +100 bps to sizing rate; cap rate remains 6.25% for value."
  ],
  "summary": "As of 2026-08-31, Hawthorn Center totals 28,800 SF across 10 suites, 9 occupied (90.0% by count; 94.44% by area). The rent roll reports $60,000 total monthly base rent; Suite 101 is confirmed at $3,000/month, expiring 2029-08-31 with a $6,000 deposit and no exercised renewal. T12 EGI is $866,400 with operating expenses of $264,000, yielding $602,400 NOI before reserves and $590,880 NCF after $11,520 reserves. The underwriting scenario sets GPBR at $780,000, 5% revenue loss, and $180,000 other income, for EGI of $921,000. With taxes $120,000, verified insurance $34,800, and a management fee of 4% of EGI ($36,840), UW operating expenses are $291,240, producing NOI before reserves of $629,760 and NCF of $625,440 after $4,320 reserves. Per lender terms, indicative value (NOI before reserves / 6.25%) is $10.076M. Loan sizing at a 6.35% sizing rate (25-year amortization) yields: LTV cap $6.298M, DSCR cap ≈$6.261M (NCF/1.25 over amortizing DS), and Debt Yield cap $6.997M. The binding constraint is DSCR, so the maximum loan is approximately $6.261M. Annual amortizing debt service at that balance and rate is ≈$500,352, giving a sizing DSCR of 1.25x and a debt yield of ≈10.06%. First-year contractual debt service matches sizing since the contractual rate equals 6.35% and there is no IO. Net cash to the borrower after a $4.2M payoff, 0.80% origination fee, and $52k fixed costs is approximately $1.96M (cash out). In the combined downside (EGI −5% with recalculated management; sizing rate +100 bps to 7.35%; cap rate unchanged), stressed NOI before reserves is ≈$585,552 and NCF ≈$581,232. The DSCR-driven stressed maximum loan is ≈$5.31M (vs. LTV cap ≈$5.86M and DY cap ≈$6.51M). Prepayment: the bank has no prepayment penalty, but any separate interest-rate swap may introduce a termination payment or receipt.",
  "blocked": [
    "Downloadable XLSX underwriting workbook with live formulas (artifact generation is not available in this control).",
    "PDF or native financing memorandum with PDF export (artifact generation is not available in this control)."
  ]
}
